+# PR600 QuickRespawn cause bridge
+
+Private f46+exactPR60091981db composition, with the separate Shooter cancellation candidate retained. This delta changes only the Resources respawn override condition. It does not modify PR600, public536, main, or the Gear calculation.
+
+The outer Resources wrapper formerly replaced every non-literal-'weapon' cause after Gear had shortened respawn. With real57AP and the consecutive-no-splat condition, native 'weapon' yielded5.5s but 'shooter'/'bomb' reverted to8.5s. Override only recognized environmental causes water/drowning/out-of-bounds/fall/void. Ordinary and unknown attack strings now retain Gear's result. Environment timers remain7s for water aliases and5.5s for fall aliases, as already configured by PR600.
+
+Focused source3/3 passes:36 combinations (0/57AP × eligibility ×9 causes), duplicate death refusal for each, four real lethal Actor.damage cases for Shooter/Bomb ×0/57AP, and four current-life-splat QR exclusion cases. No full build/CI, Charger rerun, or new physical/Switch claim. The dedicated patch excludes the dependency preparation and Shooter bridge commits.
